From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: conda-forge xorg-libxdmcp-feedstock maintainers <noreply@conda-forge.org>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid redefining the Windows getpid mapping

X11/Xos.h already maps getpid to _getpid for MSVC through Xw32defs.h.
Keep the source fallback for Windows environments where that mapping is
not present, without replacing the object-like macro with an incompatible
one-argument macro.
---
 Key.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Key.c b/Key.c
--- a/Key.c
+++ b/Key.c
@@ -53,7 +53,9 @@ getbits (long data, unsigned char *dst)
 #include <process.h>
 #define srandom srand
 #define random rand
+#ifndef getpid
 #define getpid(x) _getpid(x)
+#endif
 #endif
 
 /* Solaris 11.3.0 - 11.4.15 only define getentropy() in <sys/random.h> */
